    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d557">

                <pb facs="0875" n="853" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg853"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–1251: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the United States
                        Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-13T16:05:00-05:00">December 13,
                            1951—7:05 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Gadel 443. Re Delga 623, Dec 12. Indians South Africa. Dept endorses proposal
                    develop strong backstage support to get parties talking but believes in light
                    considerations outlined Gadel 442 Dec 13, particularly desire not further
                    alienate South Africans from UN, Del shld avoid unduly emphasizing HR issue.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
